A 268 | Jitters
N Watch for two new ghosts all over Duskwood: Ira Valor (in the woods) and Merrick Valor (on the roads) | New in Forever. Kill them when you see them: one drops Ira's Dagger, the other Merrick's Bow. Each item starts a quest (right-click it). Their exact spots are not in the data. No ghost found? Then skip the steps for 96137 / 96138 / 98447 in this segment
C 57 @ Duskwood, 20.0, 45.0 | The graveyard just north of Jitters (14-24,40-48): kill 15 Skeletal Fiends and 15 Skeletal Horrors (23-25). They are below your level: two at a time is fine
T 268 | Sven Yorgen, at his camp on the far west side (7.8,34.1)
A 323 | Sven Yorgen
C 323 @ Duskwood, 16.2, 35.3 | The northern part of the cemetery, around the crypts and the big mausoleum (13-20,27-41): 15 Skeletal Raiders (27-28), 3 Skeletal Healers (26-27), 3 Skeletal Warders (28-29). Kill the Healers first; interrupt or stun their heals and the Warders' bolts if your class can. Stay outside the crypts: Morbent Fel's house and the crypt depths are elite territory
A 225 | A Weathered Grave, at the north edge of the cemetery (17.7,29.1). Needs level 28
T 323 | Back to Sven Yorgen
A 269 | Sven Yorgen. For Stormwind, later in this segment
T 157 | Abercrombie, the hermit in the shack north-east of the cemetery (28.1,31.5). The ghouls around his hill (24-29) attack on sight: go around the east side
A 158 | Abercrombie

