C 181 @ Duskwood, 37.0, 81.5 | South road west to the Vul'Gol Ogre Mound. Zzarc'Vul (33) is at the south end of the mound (36-38,80-84) with Splinter Fist Enslavers (30-31). Clear the way in one ogre at a time, wait until he stands apart from the others, then fight him at full health with every cooldown and potion you have (if you have a pet, send it first). He is 3 levels above you. Loot the Ogre's Monocle. If he kills you twice, drop the quest. Finish Merrick's Bow here if it is still open
